---
description: Classification and rewrite stay in the skin. Leaves only see Posture.
globs: src/**/*.rs,docs/VOICE.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/VOICE.md` before changing classification or rewrite.

- The leaf never calls Jev, Ollama, or any HTTP model. It takes `Posture`.
- `JudgeHub` weighs words (Jev nouls, local chat, or the word gate). `RefineHub` rewrites if the person asks.
- Do not add Rig or another LLM crate. This crate is Rust 1.83 / edition 2021. Talk to an OpenAI-compatible server with `reqwest`.
- GPU inference stays in Ollama or llama.cpp on the person's machine. Not in the Axum binary.
- Fail to the word gate if Jev or the chat model is down. Do not block every post on a provider outage.
- Rewrite is optional. The person still submits. Classification runs on what they send.
